full-query: "A multinational company requires a hybrid database solution that consists of a managed Google Cloud database service and an on-premises bare metal infrastructure for certain legacy workloads. As a Database Engineer, which combination of services would best fulfill the company's requirements while maintaining low latency, data consistency, and ease of management?"
