  "tip": "<p>Map the requirement for <i>strong transactional consistency</i> to relational services like Cloud Spanner and verify the connectivity constraint early. When you see a need to keep legacy systems on <i>dedicated bare metal</i> with very low latency to a managed cloud database in the same metro, think of Bare Metal Solution paired with the right managed database.</p>",
